%% PoRedoImage — Auth Lifecycle (SIMPLE)
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Booting

    state "WASM booting (init mask)" as Booting
    Booting: Auth state not yet deserialized — AuthorizeRouteView holds render

    Booting --> Anonymous: no principal
    Booting --> Authenticated: principal deserialized

    state "Anonymous" as Anonymous
    Anonymous: /login page · /api returns 401

    Anonymous --> Entra: Production — Microsoft OIDC
    Anonymous --> Guest: Development — Continue as GUEST
    Anonymous --> Fake: Test — X-Fake-User header

    state "Entra ID OIDC" as Entra
    Entra: SaveTokens = false — no tokens ever reach the browser

    state "GUEST cookie sign-in" as Guest
    state "FakeAuthHandler" as Fake

    Entra --> Cookie
    Guest --> Cookie
    Fake --> Authenticated

    state "BFF cookie handshake" as Cookie
    Cookie: HttpOnly · SameSite=Strict · Secure outside Dev

    Cookie --> Authenticated

    state "Authenticated" as Authenticated
    Authenticated: FallbackPolicy = RequireAuthenticatedUser (fail-closed)
    Authenticated: /api/diag additionally needs DiagnosticsAccess

    Authenticated --> [*]: /auth/logout
